{"id":"cac035693aea2791","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-liar-sentence.md","title":"说谎者句子 lambda","display":"df-liar-sentence — 说谎者句子 lambda","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-liar-sentence","aliases":["91-df-liar-sentence"],"display":"df-liar-sentence — 说谎者句子 lambda","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-self-reference]]","[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-liar-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-liar-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-liar-sentence — 说谎者句子 lambda"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"78bf2ec267a1c34b\" href=\"?note=78bf2ec267a1c34b\" title=\"91-df-self-reference\">91-df-self-reference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" href=\"?note=ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth\">91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-liar-sentence-—-说谎者句子-$\\lambda$\">df-liar-sentence — 说谎者句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词的可算语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> (在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 中表述并能表示句法运算的算术理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\)</span> (该背景理论满足对角引理)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Liar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda)\n\\coloneqq\n\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Liar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda)\n\\coloneqq\n\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\operatorname{Liar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\operatorname{Liar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>任取满足该关系的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 即为说谎者；定义不声称固定点句唯一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> : 说谎者句子（Liar Sentence）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span>：能够证明相应句法固定点等价的背景理论</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> : 等价</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：说谎者句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>是说&quot;我是假的&quot;的自指句子。其形式定义是通过取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x) = \\neg T(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x) = \\neg T(x)\\)</span>应用对角线引理得到的固定点。</p>\n<p>说谎者悖论：\n单凭固定点等价并不产生形式矛盾。矛盾还需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 无限制地双向释放/捕获，或对含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 使用全局 T-模式。</p>\n<p>真理理论的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>的状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>可构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，但其公理模式只覆盖基础语言</td>\n<td>通常不判定相应真理断言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTB</td>\n<td>同样不把统一双条件应用到含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span></td>\n<td>避免无条件析取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>经典对象理论配合强 Kleene 预期语义</td>\n<td>在标准固定点中留作间隙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>用受控捕获/释放规则公理化迭代真理</td>\n<td>不能概括为“双重真值”</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>说谎者句子是真理理论的核心测试案例，展示了各理论处理悖论的不同策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-liar-sentence-—-说谎者句子-$\\lambda$","text":"df-liar-sentence — 说谎者句子 $\\lambda$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-self-reference","status":"resolved","id":"78bf2ec267a1c34b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-self-reference]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth","status":"resolved","id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Liar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda)\n\\coloneqq\n\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\operatorname{Liar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x) = \\neg T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":2313,"backlinks":[{"id":"387103572d3822c3","an